# Static Shoals (CIPlay static_shoals): the main bar at 1.5 m round -10 -4; Teo's note, the Fleet chest (with the
# zipline handle), the screechers, mast 4's hut on the east bar, the flare locker, the workshop.
island Static Shoals
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Static
zone barge
read Teo's note
expect step 1
open Fleet chest
wait 3
expect step 2
kill Screecher
expect animals Screecher 0
expect step 3
zone mast_4
expect step 4
open Mast 4 hut
wait 3
expect step 5
open Flare locker
wait 3
expect step 6
read Net house book
use netradio
expect message radio is dead
expect step 7
open Mechanic's toolbox
wait 3
expect story raft-Tangaroa_GeneratorPart 1
expect step 8
use netgen
expect message The power is on
use netradio
expect shown netdrop
expect step 9
open Supply drop
wait 3
expect step 10
open Mast workshop
wait 3
expect done
